.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt LSPCI 1
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm lspci
.Nd print the kernel's enumerated PCI device list
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar path
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints the contents of
.Pa /proc/pci
or an alternate proc-style path supplied on the command line.
It is a thin inspection tool over the kernel PCI bus layer.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr proc 5
